/E (ByteAnd Bite provides a simple, menu-driven canteen ordering system developed using Java and MySQL. It allows students to order multiple food items in a single transaction, calculates the total bill automatically, and updates food stock in the database. By combining Java OOP concepts with database connectivity, the system reduces manual work, improves order accuracy, and makes canteen management more efficient.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
